        "body": "\u2026lemetry, and nero-38 delivery\n\n<!-- greptile_comment -->\n\n<!-- greptile_summary -->\n\n<h2><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=107494315&amp;sig=e0bb80552c41dcc000028bb9c547c44a1c85c7f5d80e23b1421136a7227cceff\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/RetriggerDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"Retrigger\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/-/switch-tenant?tenant=nero&amp;next=%2Frajnagani31%2Fnero%2Fpull%2F51&amp;utm_source=greptile_review&amp;utm_medium=github&amp;utm_campaign=view_in_greptile\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptileDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"View in Greptile\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a>Confidence Score: 0/5</h2>\n\n<!-- greptile-risk -->\n\nFix container startup, failed reviews being reported as successful, paid-tier routing, and unsafe credit updates before merging.\n\n<h2>Findings</h2>\n\n1. <img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Containers cannot reach PostgreSQL** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324410\">\u25b6</a>\n2. <img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Failed reviews look successful** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324416\">\u25b6</a>\n3. <img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Paid jobs use free routing** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324421\">\u25b6</a>\n4. <img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Long errors block successful reviews** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324424\">\u25b6</a>\n5. <img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Reviews overwrite usage counts** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324431\">\u25b6</a>\n6. <img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**One review gets charged twice** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324435\">\u25b6</a>\n7. <img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Containers race on migrations** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324463\">\u25b6</a>\n8. <img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Monthly counts never reset** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324439\">\u25b6</a>\n9. <img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Saved charges do not match** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324443\">\u25b6</a>\n10. <img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Failover test depends on secrets** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324447\">\u25b6</a>\n11. <img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Every attempt is numbered one** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324449\">\u25b6</a>\n12. <img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Failed call time disappears** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324455\">\u25b6</a>\n13. <img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Minified files are not skipped** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/51#discussion_r4578324458\">\u25b6</a>\n\n<details open><summary><h3>Summary</h3></summary>\n\nAdds a LangGraph review engine with Groq/OpenAI routing, fallback calls, saved AI telemetry, and per-user usage records.\n\n- Pull-request files now go through a structured AI review workflow.\n- Review tiers now choose which AI provider handles a file.\n- Review jobs now save AI usage details and update user quotas.\n- The container now prepares database changes before launching the app.\n- The sample webhook payload now uses a different review example.\n</details>\n\n<details open><summary><h3>Diagram</h3></summary>\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%\nflowchart TD\n    Startup[Container starts] --> Migration[Run Alembic migrations]\n    Migration --> Process[Start server or worker]\n    File[File review task] --> Preprocess[Check patch and file type]\n    Preprocess -->|Reviewable| Router[Choose provider from tier]\n    Preprocess -->|Skipped| Audit[Finalize file result]\n    Router --> Invoke[Call provider]\n    Invoke -->|Success| Audit\n    Invoke -->|Failure and attempts remain| Fallback[Choose fallback]\n    Fallback --> Invoke\n    Invoke -->|Attempts exhausted| Audit\n    Audit --> Logs[Save call logs and file result]\n    Logs --> Aggregate[Gather file results]\n    Aggregate --> Job[Save job totals]\n    Job --> Quota[Update user count and credits]\n    Quota --> GitHub[Post GitHub review]\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- greptile_confidence_score:0 -->\n\n<sub>Reviews (1) \u00b7 Last reviewed commit: [\"feat(ai-engine): integrate LangGraph rev...\"](https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/commit/59bf9b47116d9b16775c75a40055c7da86e8e788) \u00b7 [Reviewed by Greptile](https://www.greptile.com/?utm_source=greptile_review&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=review_public&utm_content=rajnagani31/nero)</sub>\n\n<!-- /greptile_comment -->",
